06:39.540 --> 06:41.110
<b>Hey.</b>

06:41.650 --> 06:42.810
<b>And?</b>

06:42.810 --> 06:43.580
<b>And what?</b>

06:44.220 --> 06:46.020
<b>You saw a mysterious light.</b>

06:46.020 --> 06:47.830
<b>And since it might have been fighting another light...</b>

06:47.830 --> 06:49.350
<b>...you thought it was more
than just a light...</b>

06:49.350 --> 06:51.990
<b>...and it had some actual form, but...</b>

06:51.990 --> 06:55.560
<b>...it vanished before you could determine
what that form was.</b>

06:56.130 --> 06:58.160
<b>Is that about right?</b>

06:58.160 --> 06:59.730
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:59.730 --> 07:01.100
<b>And?</b>

07:01.100 --> 07:02.600
<b>Huh? And...</b>

07:02.600 --> 07:06.140
<b>If you’re wondering how it could have been
there, there’s not really much to worry about...</b>

07:06.140 --> 07:07.810
<b>...since you actually saw it.</b>

07:09.540 --> 07:14.080
<b>My husband said he saw what he thought
was a kappa at the Sakawa River.</b>

07:14.080 --> 07:16.050
<b>And you believed that?</b>

07:16.050 --> 07:18.720
<b>It’s because I believe his words.</b>

07:18.720 --> 07:19.680
<b>Is this an issue of trust?</b>

07:19.690 --> 07:22.250
<b>You’ll have to decide if you believe you saw it...</b>

07:22.250 --> 07:29.560
<b>...or if you’ll pretend you didn’t see it so
you can fit in with those around you.</b>

07:29.560 --> 07:32.660
<b>But there are times when your eyes play
tricks on you, or you hallucinate...</b>

07:32.660 --> 07:33.560
<b>Rieko.</b>

07:34.370 --> 07:41.340
<b>Did you tell me this so I could laugh and
tell you it was just some illusion?</b>

07:45.340 --> 07:47.850
<b>I don’t think so...</b>

07:49.310 --> 07:54.250
<b>I just... don’t know what it was,
and was feeling a little creeped out...</b>

07:54.250 --> 07:56.290
<b>...and scared.</b>

07:57.020 --> 08:01.590
<b>If you can’t believe in yourself,
you won’t be able to believe in others.</b>

08:01.590 --> 08:03.460
<b>But... but...</b>

08:03.460 --> 08:06.300
<b>...there’s no way people should
be able to see things like that.</b>

08:07.670 --> 08:10.270
<b>There’s more out there than what your eyes can see.</b>

08:16.710 --> 08:19.180
<b>Grammy, what do you mean by that?</b>

08:22.550 --> 08:28.150
<b>For example, many battles are written
about in legends and myths.</b>

08:28.990 --> 08:31.920
<b>Light and darkness, good and evil...</b>

08:31.920 --> 08:34.630
<b>Two opposing forces.</b>

08:34.630 --> 08:39.930
<b>You might’ve actually peeped
in on one of those things.</b>

08:40.700 --> 08:43.330
<b>It might turn out that it was
actually something like that.</b>

08:46.810 --> 08:49.710
<b>Forget it. I can’t keep up with you anymore.</b>

08:49.710 --> 08:52.640
<b>Then let’s put that aside for now...</b>

08:52.640 --> 08:55.550
<b>...and have you julienne this cabbage.</b>

09:00.520 --> 09:04.560
<b>I see you’re still being a bad
girl and not going to school.</b>

09:04.560 --> 09:07.530
<b>Speak for yourself.</b>

09:07.530 --> 09:10.800
<b>Along with my league matches...</b>

09:10.800 --> 09:13.200
<b>...I have to keep the records of other shogi games...</b>

09:13.200 --> 09:17.000
<b>...help out at the shogi workshop, go to the game study sessions at my teacher’s place...</b>

09:17.000 --> 09:18.500
<b>At any rate, I have a lot to do.</b>

09:19.240 --> 09:20.570
<b>You sound busy.</b>

09:20.570 --> 09:22.240
<b>That’s true, but...</b>

09:22.240 --> 09:25.640
<b>...if I go pro, I intend to drop out of high school.</b>

09:25.640 --> 09:27.550
<b>I hope you can go pro soon.</b>

09:27.550 --> 09:28.650
<b>I will.</b>

09:31.820 --> 09:33.550
<b>Did I annoy you by calling you out here?</b>

09:33.550 --> 09:36.290
<b>If you did, I wouldn’t have come.</b>

09:36.290 --> 09:37.220
<b>Is that so?</b>

09:37.220 --> 09:38.260
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:42.560 --> 09:43.430
<b>Something happened, didn’t it?</b>

09:48.230 --> 09:50.400
<b>There’s something I want you to look at.</b>

09:51.270 --> 09:52.670
<b>This.</b>

09:59.380 --> 10:00.710
<b>What?</b>

10:00.710 --> 10:01.980
<b>I’m talking about...</b>

10:06.820 --> 10:08.390
<b>...this.</b>

10:09.890 --> 10:11.520
<b>Er... what is it?</b>

10:13.260 --> 10:14.830
<b>Are you joking around?</b>

10:14.830 --> 10:17.330
<b>Who’s joking around with who?</b>

10:19.700 --> 10:21.000
<b>Can’t you see it?</b>

10:26.640 --> 10:28.810
<b>You really can’t see it?</b>

10:36.680 --> 10:37.850
<b>Right here.</b>

10:47.830 --> 10:48.930
<b>This.</b>

11:00.410 --> 11:04.280
<b>I... can’t really tell exactly,
but some sort of light is...</b>

11:04.280 --> 11:07.140
<b>Yes... I think that’s its true form.</b>

11:07.150 --> 11:10.410
<b>But... well, I don’t know
what to call it, but...</b>

11:10.420 --> 11:14.620
<b>...this “container” has these thin lines on it,
and seems to be streamlining that light.</b>

11:17.860 --> 11:19.320
<b>It exists, right?</b>

11:22.260 --> 11:23.790
<b>This thing’s...</b>

11:23.800 --> 11:26.060
<b>It’s been here this entire time.</b>

11:26.700 --> 11:29.770
<b>I... couldn’t see it at first.</b>

11:29.770 --> 11:31.000
<b>Really.</b>

11:31.000 --> 11:35.540
<b>But after touching it and imagining
what you described...</b>

11:38.180 --> 11:40.510
<b>Is this really...</b>

12:03.540 --> 12:05.440
<b>I saw something I shouldn’t be able to see...</b>

12:38.400 --> 12:39.640
<b>Excuse me...</b>

12:40.410 --> 12:42.340
<b>What do you think of this?</b>

12:45.240 --> 12:46.440
<b>“This”?</b>

12:46.450 --> 12:47.580
<b>Yes.</b>

12:52.080 --> 12:54.790
<b>I’m not a palm reader.</b>

12:56.020 --> 12:57.560
<b>She can’t see it.</b>

12:57.560 --> 13:01.790
<b>So some people can see Bun-chan,
and some can’t...</b>

13:01.790 --> 13:03.560
<b>“Bun-chan”?</b>

13:03.560 --> 13:07.260
<b>It’s the name I gave it.</b>

13:07.270 --> 13:09.570
<b>Shigeki...</b>

13:09.570 --> 13:11.670
<b>...what do you think Bun-chan is?</b>

13:11.670 --> 13:13.600
<b>Well...</b>

13:13.610 --> 13:19.010
<b>With its shape, and it floating in the air
like that, I have no clue whatsoever.</b>

13:19.010 --> 13:20.810
<b>I’ve never seen anything like this before.</b>

13:22.880 --> 13:25.450
<b>Its appearance makes it seem mechanical...</b>

13:25.450 --> 13:28.190
<b>...but it doesn’t feel artificial.</b>

13:29.220 --> 13:30.960
<b>Artificial?</b>

13:31.620 --> 13:33.560
<b>From its appearance, yeah.</b>

13:33.560 --> 13:35.290
<b>I can’t really explain it, though.</b>

13:35.290 --> 13:36.960
<b>Is that so?</b>

13:36.960 --> 13:38.930
<b>Don’t you think so?</b>

13:39.670 --> 13:43.730
<b>I never thought of it as artificial.</b>

13:43.740 --> 13:47.000
<b>I thought Bun-chan was born.</b>

13:47.010 --> 13:48.340
<b>Born?</b>

13:49.340 --> 13:50.910
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:56.310 --> 13:59.650
<b>I also saw something I shouldn’t
be able to see!</b>

13:56.310 --> 13:59.650
<b>Makki</b>

14:03.320 --> 14:05.320
<b>Don’t tell anyone.</b>

14:05.320 --> 14:06.720
<b>About Bun-chan?</b>

14:06.730 --> 14:07.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:08.890 --> 14:09.790
<b>Why?</b>

14:12.930 --> 14:13.760
<b>Umm, you see...</b>

14:14.670 --> 14:15.770
<b>Yeah?</b>

14:15.770 --> 14:18.240
<b>Well... because of the catfish.</b>

14:18.240 --> 14:20.810
<b>The red tail catfish.</b>

14:20.810 --> 14:22.470
<b>It’s a catfish from the Amazon.</b>

14:22.470 --> 14:23.610
<b>Okay...</b>

14:23.610 --> 14:25.210
<b>It was first on a commercial...</b>

14:25.210 --> 14:29.010
<b>...and then it spread all over TV,
suddenly becoming the center of attention.</b>

14:31.980 --> 14:35.890
<b>It was about ten centimeters long,
and many were imported.</b>

14:35.890 --> 14:38.060
<b>Apparently, lots were sold.</b>

14:38.060 --> 14:44.600
<b>It turns out that the catfish can grow to
over one meter in its natural habitat.</b>

14:44.600 --> 14:50.430
<b>I wonder how long the last of its
kind were able to stay there...</b>

14:52.140 --> 14:54.710
<b>You want it to be left alone.</b>

14:54.710 --> 14:55.970
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:57.010 --> 15:00.910
<b>You must be thinking that you
don’t want it to be sold off.</b>

15:01.380 --> 15:08.220
<b>Bun-chan is something special,
and not something you can just purchase.</b>

15:08.220 --> 15:10.890
<b>But if someone were to find out about it...</b>

15:10.890 --> 15:15.930
<b>...it might become merchandise all of a sudden.</b>

15:15.930 --> 15:20.870
<b>And in the worst case scenario, there’s even
the chance that Bun-chan-hunting would begin.</b>

15:22.330 --> 15:24.940
<b>That’s what you’re worried about, right?</b>

15:26.970 --> 15:28.710
<b>Probably...</b>

15:28.710 --> 15:30.340
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:30.340 --> 15:36.610
<b>Because you can put my hazy thoughts into words...</b>

15:36.620 --> 15:39.350
<b>Because you can understand me...</b>

15:39.850 --> 15:42.790
<b>You showed me.</b>

15:42.790 --> 15:44.190
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:44.190 --> 15:47.090
<b>Don’t worry, I won’t tell anyone.</b>

15:47.760 --> 15:52.800
<b>Though if you hadn’t shown me,
nobody else would have been able to see it.</b>

15:58.840 --> 16:00.170
<b>What do you mean?</b>

16:00.170 --> 16:02.970
<b>Like I said, I could see it.</b>

16:02.970 --> 16:03.870
<b>Where?</b>

16:03.880 --> 16:05.480
<b>Right down that way.</b>

16:05.480 --> 16:09.250
<b>I saw Kobayakawa and Tanigawa
talking near the river.</b>

16:09.250 --> 16:10.250
<b>And then?</b>

16:10.250 --> 16:13.020
<b>I couldn’t hear what they were saying, but...</b>

16:13.020 --> 16:18.220
<b>...I understood that Tanigawa was trying
to show Kobayakawa something...</b>

16:18.220 --> 16:22.630
<b>But at first, I couldn’t see it at all...</b>

16:22.630 --> 16:28.530
<b>Then, I think... Kobayakawa touched it.</b>

16:28.530 --> 16:30.370
<b>And all of a sudden...</b>

16:30.370 --> 16:31.740
<b>All of a sudden?</b>

16:31.740 --> 16:35.470
<b>I faintly saw a pale blue light.</b>

16:35.470 --> 16:38.040
<b>So it was a pale blue light...</b>

16:38.040 --> 16:42.780
<b>It looked like Kobayakawa suddenly became
able to see it too, and was surprised.</b>

16:42.780 --> 16:44.780
<b>So Shigeki saw it, too.</b>

16:44.780 --> 16:45.680
<b>Probably.</b>

16:46.520 --> 16:48.320
<b>Wait a sec.</b>

16:48.320 --> 16:49.190
<b>What?</b>

16:49.190 --> 16:53.490
<b>Does that mean Kisa has something
we shouldn’t be able to see?</b>

16:54.190 --> 16:55.860
<b>Yeah...</b>

16:55.860 --> 16:58.360
<b>Why? What does this mean?</b>

17:00.500 --> 17:02.400
<b>Rieko.</b>

17:02.400 --> 17:03.230
<b>Coming.</b>

17:03.800 --> 17:07.270
<b>Thanks. If something else happens,
let me know, okay?</b>

17:07.270 --> 17:08.340
<b>Bye now.</b>

17:11.080 --> 17:12.910
<b>Okay...</b>

17:16.420 --> 17:18.380
<b>Hey, Class Rep.</b>

17:19.820 --> 17:22.120
<b>Umm... have you decided what you want?</b>

17:22.120 --> 17:24.660
<b>Oh, did something happen?</b>

17:25.560 --> 17:26.390
<b>Nothing, really.</b>

17:26.390 --> 17:28.830
<b>No, something did.</b>

17:28.830 --> 17:31.500
<b>You’re not acting like yourself, Riezo.</b>

17:31.500 --> 17:33.000
<b>Quit doing that.</b>

17:33.000 --> 17:34.100
<b>Doing what?</b>

17:34.100 --> 17:35.100
<b>Calling me “Riezo.”</b>

17:35.100 --> 17:38.670
<b>But you’ve been “Riezo”
since we were kids.</b>

17:38.670 --> 17:43.270
<b>Then that would make you
“Crybaby Shigeki,” wouldn’t it?</b>

17:43.280 --> 17:45.640
<b>Ouch!</b>

17:45.640 --> 17:49.210
<b>That’s just how it is,
Mr. Kobayakawa 3-dan.</b>

17:49.210 --> 17:51.080
<b>That hurts, too.</b>

17:51.720 --> 17:54.550
<b>But aren’t you about to become 4-dan?</b>

17:55.020 --> 17:56.550
<b>I am.</b>

17:56.560 --> 17:59.020
<b>If I wasn’t, there’d be no reason
for me to be in the Shoreikai.</b>

18:00.730 --> 18:02.890
<b>I’m sure you can definitely reach it.</b>

18:04.000 --> 18:08.100
<b>Tokimiya</b>

18:04.900 --> 18:07.100
<b>Is my deluxe omelette rice okay with you?</b>

18:07.100 --> 18:08.030
<b>Of course.</b>

18:08.030 --> 18:09.570
<b>Again?</b>

18:08.100 --> 18:08.130
<b>Tokimiya</b>

18:08.130 --> 18:08.170
<b>Tokimiya</b>

