<b>Tokimiya</b>

18:08.430 --> 18:08.470
<b>Tokimiya</b>

18:08.470 --> 18:08.500
<b>Tokimiya</b>

18:08.500 --> 18:11.470
<b>Tokimiya</b>

18:09.570 --> 18:11.470
<b>Well, I do love it!</b>

18:13.140 --> 18:14.940
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

18:14.940 --> 18:17.110
<b>Ah, this is it!</b>

18:17.110 --> 18:18.980
<b>Thanks for the food.</b>

18:21.380 --> 18:22.880
<b>Hey, Shigeki.</b>

18:24.420 --> 18:26.650
<b>I’m going to ask you something weird, but...</b>

18:26.650 --> 18:29.590
<b>Go ahead and ask,
but I can’t guarantee I’ll answer.</b>

18:29.590 --> 18:31.220
<b>Okay.</b>

18:31.220 --> 18:34.230
<b>Have you ever seen something that
you shouldn’t be able to see?</b>

18:38.300 --> 18:39.860
<b>Something I shouldn’t be able to see?</b>

18:39.870 --> 18:41.170
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:46.540 --> 18:48.340
<b>I...</b>

18:48.340 --> 18:50.440
<b>...always see where I’ll place
my shogi pieces...</b>

18:50.440 --> 18:52.280
<b>...and where I think my opponent will place his.</b>

18:53.350 --> 18:55.350
<b>I’m always looking at that invisible board in my head.</b>

18:56.420 --> 18:58.220
<b>Can you see that?</b>

18:58.220 --> 19:01.590
<b>There are some things I can see,
and some things I can’t.</b>

19:01.590 --> 19:02.290
<b>But...</b>

19:03.390 --> 19:06.990
<b>...trying to see it is the most important part.</b>

19:13.430 --> 19:14.970
<b>What about you?</b>

19:15.430 --> 19:18.500
<b>I was just wondering why you’d
ask something like that.</b>

19:20.910 --> 19:21.940
<b>Did you see something?</b>

19:23.680 --> 19:25.140
<b>That’s my secret.</b>

19:56.710 --> 19:58.080
<b><i>So people can’t see it...</i></b>

20:02.550 --> 20:04.450
<b>Oh my, Jennifer-chan...</b>

20:05.380 --> 20:08.090
<b>Come on, stop that, Jennifer-chan.</b>

20:27.040 --> 20:29.610
<b>My my, what’s wrong, Jennifer-chan?</b>

20:29.610 --> 20:31.710
<b>What are you so afraid of?</b>

20:31.710 --> 20:33.480
<b>How strange...</b>

20:33.480 --> 20:35.650
<b>Let’s go. Come on.</b>

20:42.560 --> 20:46.220
<b>So dogs can see you...</b>

20:56.870 --> 20:59.310
<b>How mysterious.</b>

21:18.460 --> 21:20.460
<b>It’s possible...</b>

21:20.460 --> 21:24.300
<b>...that this world’s framework might change.</b>

22:05.600 --> 22:10.810
<b>When there’s news from the port of Yokohama,
it’s not the same if you don’t come in by boat!</b>

22:35.370 --> 22:37.670
<b>You’re here, aren’t you?</b>

22:39.540 --> 22:43.370
<b>I’ll definitely get you this time!</b>

22:52.220 --> 22:59.790
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.220 --> 22:59.790
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.790 --> 23:06.500
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.790 --> 23:06.500
words that no one else knew.

23:09.500 --> 23:17.000
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.500 --> 23:17.000
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.000 --> 23:23.680
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.000 --> 23:23.680
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.680 --> 23:31.120
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.680 --> 23:31.120
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.120 --> 23:35.920
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.120 --> 23:35.920
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.920 --> 23:44.600
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.920 --> 23:44.600
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.600 --> 23:53.200
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.600 --> 23:53.200
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.200 --> 24:01.980
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.200 --> 24:01.980
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:01.980 --> 24:10.690
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:01.980 --> 24:10.690
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.690 --> 24:19.230
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.690 --> 24:19.230
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.970 --> 24:22.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.400 --> 24:21.910
<b>Taruto, what are you struggling with over there?</b>

24:21.910 --> 24:23.570
<b>It’s the title for the next episode...</b>

24:23.580 --> 24:25.880
<b>Let’s see... “Next time: Urban Folklore...”</b>

24:25.880 --> 24:26.880
<b>What’s that mean?</b>

24:26.880 --> 24:30.080
<b>I know. Let me tell you the urban
folklore of the city I’m from.</b>

24:30.080 --> 24:31.750
<b>The town you’re from is Tana, isn’t it?</b>

24:31.750 --> 24:32.920
<b>I wouldn’t really call it a city.</b>

24:32.920 --> 24:37.360
<b>In my city, there’s this festival called
the “Dog Dance” every summer...</b>

24:37.360 --> 24:39.820
<b>...and everyone dresses up as a dog and dances.</b>

24:39.830 --> 24:41.060
<b>I’ve never heard of that.</b>

24:41.060 --> 24:44.430
<b>But a mysterious event happened
at the Dog Dance one summer!</b>

24:44.430 --> 24:47.330
<b>A huge group of dogs suddenly came
running onto the event grounds.</b>

24:47.330 --> 24:49.870
<b>And leading them was a dandy, hat-wearing dog–</b>

24:49.870 --> 24:51.970
<b>That aside, next episode’s title is...</b>

24:51.970 --> 24:53.110
<b>“Urban Folklore,” huh?</b>

24:53.110 --> 24:55.010
<b>I don’t know what that means!</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:58.080
<b>Weren’t you listening to me?!</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>Urban Folklore</b>
